{"version":1,"content":"<p>剛果民主共和國（簡稱剛果（金））衛生部周二（27日）公布，截至周日本輪伊波拉疫情累計確診10060宗、4887人死亡，病死率約48.6%，波及全國26省中的8省，為該國歷來最大、最致命的一輪疫情。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:01:12.322356+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:23:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:38:10.495806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:58:18.624630+00:00","content_hash":"c3d0563f82684c03b17adc914b34a2d6f13e02bef318f68fd29af4edfa879cc3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}